OL,3,GNEWSA'My parish isn't a no-go zone for
OL,4,Awhite people'
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative MP Blake Stephenson has
OL,7,Fsaid there are parts of Luton "where
OL,8,Fwhite people won't go".
OL,10,F"They're like no-go zones," he told a
OL,11,Ffringe event at his party's conference.
OL,13,FThe town, where 40% of people were born
OL,14,Foutside England, was a "shadow of its
OL,15,Fformer self".
OL,17,FHow have some of those who live and
OL,18,Fwork in some of Luton's most diverse
OL,19,Fsuburbs responded?
